      "widgets_values": [
        "subject_definitions:\n<Subject 1> A tiger with orange fur and black stripes, depicted in a close-up profile shot, originating from <Picture 1>.\n<Subject 2> A tiger with orange and black striped fur, depicted in a medium shot lying down in bright green grass, originating from <Picture 2>.\n\nsummary:\n[reference generation] The target video depicts a tiger mother interacting with her cub, using the appearance of the tigers from <Picture 1> and <Picture 2>.\n\nretention_analysis:\n<Subject 1>: fully_preserved - <Picture 1>\n<Subject 2>: fully_preserved - <Picture 2>\n<Picture 1>: fully_preserved - N/A\n<Picture 2>: fully_preserved - N/A\n\ndetailed_description:\nThe scene is rendered with photorealistic fidelity, capturing the natural environment of a grassy habitat.\n[Shot 1] A close-up profile shot of <Subject 1>, the mother tiger, is established in a lush, green, grassy environment under natural lighting. <Subject 1> is positioned in profile, exhibiting the orange fur with black stripes seen in <Picture 1>. The camera holds steady on <Subject 1> as the action begins. The mother tiger slowly turns its head towards the right, its posture suggesting maternal attention. The focus remains sharp on the tiger's features. The scene transitions smoothly to incorporate <Subject 2>.\n[Shot 2] At 00:02.500, the composition widens slightly to include <Subject 2>, the cub, which is lying down in the bright green grass, matching the setting of <Picture 2>. <Subject 2> is positioned near <Subject 1>. <Subject 1> lowers its head towards <Subject 2>. The mother tiger gently nudges the cub with its nose, an act of care. <Subject 2> lifts its head slightly, looking up towards <Subject 1> with its mouth slightly open, mirroring the expression in <Picture 2>. The interaction is tender and protective. The camera maintains a medium shot framing both tigers as they engage in this moment of connection. The final state holds the two tigers in close proximity, the mother attending to the cub, for the remainder of the duration.\n\noverall_soundscape:\nThe soundscape is dominated by natural ambient sounds of the grassy environment.\n\nnon_diegetic_music:\nN/A"
      ]
